# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Removed from GitHub on purpose (2026-10-30), still present on the developer's disk.
#
# Rationale: these are historical artefacts — the archived Tauri/Rust tree, pre-Electron planning documents,
# the research corpus those plans were built from, UI screenshots from a superseded phase, regenerable logs, and
# a testing evaluation written for the Tauri architecture that ADR-0020 retired. They add repository weight
# without helping anyone read or run the app. They were untracked with `git rm --cached`, so a clone no longer
# carries them and no working tree lost anything.
#
# NOT ignored here, because the verification gate reads them at runtime — a fresh clone must still pass
# `npm run verify`: docs/research/2026-10-29-universal-modpack-install.md,
# docs/research/2026-10-29-p1c-format-census.md, docs/research/2026-10-29-claim-verification.md,
# docs/audit/23-synthesis-correct-design.md, docs/audit/24-deviations-register.md, and the two real-artefact
# inputs docs/evidence/adapters/prism-real-instance.zip + atl-real-instance.json.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
legacy/
tester/
docs/research/
# ...except the three documents the conformance gate parses at runtime (see the note above).
!docs/research/2026-10-29-universal-modpack-install.md
!docs/research/2026-10-29-p1c-format-census.md
!docs/research/2026-10-29-claim-verification.md
docs/implementation/
docs/evidence/phase8-ui/
docs/README.md
docs/electron-port-plan.md
docs/electron-completion-plan-summary.md
docs/evidence/*.log
docs/evidence/*.gz
docs/evidence/*.jsonl

